  <description>
    <p>Reads the Serbian eID, foreigner ID card and residence permit through a USB smart card reader: personal data, signature check, token certificates, PIN change, file signing and a PDF printout.</p>
    <p>The card reader service (pcscd) must run on the host system. Independent implementation, not affiliated with MUP RS or NetSeT/Veridos.</p>
  </description>
